dinary build passed.\n- The frozen archive was inspected against the exact source and all **682 runtime files**. Original release assets and qualification evidence are attached.\n\nSource: `a13ab970222498d7c5fa7f62f9fc04fe436979d5`. Source PR: #87. Predecessor: [v0.60.2](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/tag/v0.60.2), retained unchanged in Archive03.\n\nGitHub Pages and affected browser journeys require verification after deployment. **P03 navigation and P05 presentation remain incomplete**; physical controllers, real mobile devices and fresh offline operation are not certified by these results.\n"}